    'excerpt' => 'Outline 1. The Short Answer: You Don\'t There is no public registration option Accounts are generated based on your role 2. How Accounts Are Created by Role Role How Account Is Crea',
    'text' => 'Outline 1. The Short Answer: You Don\'t There is no public registration option Accounts are generated based on your role 2. How Accounts Are Created by Role Role How Account Is Created Requestor (Applicant) At the end of intake form, you create credentials (optional but recommended) Volunteer Fill out volunteer interest form → account generated Staff (Caseworker, PM, etc.) Organization admin creates your account Subcontractor Project manager or admin invites you Assessor Organization admin creates your account Bursar Organization admin creates your account Admin (Organization) Your organization designates you Envoy Coalition leadership creates your account 3. I\'m a Requestor - What Do I Do? Complete the intake form (14 pages) At the end, you\'ll see an option to create login credentials This is optional but recommended (track your application status) Choose a username (suggested: first initial + last name) System generates a complicated password (write it down!) You can change password after first login 4. I\'m a Volunteer - What Do I Do? Fill out the volunteer interest form You\'ll receive an email with your account details Login to access volunteer dashboard See available "quests" (tasks) matching your skills 5. I\'m Staff - What Do I Do? Your admin will set up your account You\'ll receive an email with login details Login and set your password Your dashboard is role-specific 6. Is There a Demo Account? Yes! For public exploration Uses placeholder data (not real cases) Great for training and exploration Request access through the website 7. I Forgot My Password Use "Forgot Password" link on login page Reset link sent to your email You can also ask your organization admin',
  ),
